\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Physical lineage on the production mesh, one quantity per panel: (a) loss, (b) peak temperature, (c) die warpage, (d) critical-joint displacement driver, per named scenario, with whiskers at the measured discretisation uncertainty (hatched: critical joint at or above the solder melting onset, an infeasibility result shown but not ranked); (e) local inelastic strain per cycle on the production local mesh with its uncertainty $U$ (open marker: joint beyond the constitutive calibration, extrapolated; cross: joint at or above the solder melting onset, no valid response); (f) in-plane joint displacement driver at every legal ball site in the continuous-input scenario, critical joint circled. Matched-reference errors and runtimes are in Table\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:accspeed}.}}{16}{figure.8}}
